  "trigger_name": "Emergency / Protective Custody",
  "summary_html": "Immediate state action to **protect a child in imminent danger**. Federal law (ASFA/IV-E) ties funding to court findings on **reasonable efforts**, and constitutional limits (due process, 4th/14th Amendments) constrain warrantless removals.",
  "authority_html": "- **ASFA / SSA Title IV-E** — reasonable-efforts findings; permanency timelines  \n- **CFSR (45 CFR Part 1355)** — federal oversight of removal decision quality  \n- **Constitutional constraints** — enforced via §1983 actions; due process & search/seizure jurisprudence (not listed in file but governs practice)",
